ward and draw their attention. Don't let them get close to the Commander!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dolls skilled in close combat move in to pin down the Nytos."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, a familiar figure dashes past the frontline in a black blur, heading straight for the automated units engaging DEFY."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dandelion, give me a hand!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, alright. Enemy fire control systems will crash in 0.5 seconds."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Grey_Hand_Mech","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An automated unit equipped with a 20mm cannon raises its barrel toward M16 in midair, about to unleash a devastating barrage."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOff","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But before it can fire, a flood of error data crashes its system."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16 fires a grenade, destroying it and eliminating the most dangerous firepower on the field."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_TT33Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"