 with faint blue liquid. It is not an unfamiliar sight to them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander? You don't look well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm fine... These devices... resemble those from Avernus."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_TT33Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No life signs in the containers. The experiments haven't begun. These... are just empty vessels."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aside from the liquid, the tanks contain nothing else. The Commander lets out a quiet sigh of relief—the nightmarish sight in their memory has not yet become reality. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yet their very presence proves that such experiments are already being prepared."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The evil once eradicated in Operation Muromets is now gathering strength to return."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's too much clutter here. Stay alert for ambushes—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As the group's attention is drawn to the equipment, an unnatural gust of wind sweeps through the sealed room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cut_Watermelon","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"1","raw":"CGDelay"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"effect","value":"%%code=202406_Hit%%","raw":"common_effect"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A streak of white flashes across the Commander’s vision. Before they can figure out what it is, they lose all sensation in their body."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They feel like a block thrown into the air, spinning uncontrollably."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tinnitus_0","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"C-Commander!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shit!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander hears the DEFY Dolls shouting, but the spinning world makes it impossible to locate them. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As their consciousness fades, they finally realize what just happened—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As the Commander hits the ground, they see their own body collapsed on the other end of the room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A fountain of blood erupts from the severed neck."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"1","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Darkness takes them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"[END]"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Well. I didn't quite expect that either."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even among the Nytos, she's one of the most unusual individuals. Compared to the others, her faith and loyalty to William are the weakest. If there had been any other option, he likely wouldn't have chosen to repair and reactivate her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She didn't kill you over anything personal. She doesn't even bear any grudges against DEFY. Perhaps deep down, she already knew that this would be the outcome between herself and the one she loves."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Ah, now even I'm getting emotional."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, this should be the last time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's start over."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
